[I] Lightweight HTTP proxy

[T] Tinyproxy is a small, efficient HTTP/SSL proxy daemon that is useful in
[T] small networks where a larger proxy would be too resource intensive or a
[T] security risk. It buffers fast server responses and relays them at the
[T] speed the client accepts.

[U] https://tinyproxy.github.io/

[A] Tinyproxy Authors
